{"sha": "3f895897aa7c215059c175fd7bd6b3e6be37190e419aa0332e40cb5cee504254", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "$E_m \\geq 0$：$\\tfrac12 mv_e^2 - GMm/R = 0$。取 $T = \\qty{86164}{s}$，由开普勒第三定律。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[霍曼转移]\\label{prop:b1:central-forces:hohmann}", "\\index{霍曼转移}", "要使卫星从半径为 $r_1$ 的圆轨道转移到", "共面、半径为 $r_2 > r_1$ 的圆轨道，只需两次短暂点火：在 $r_1$ 处点火，", "进入近地点为 $r_1$、远地点为 $r_2$ 的\\emph{转移椭圆}", "（$a = (r_1 + r_2)/2$），滑行半个周期，", "再在 $r_2$ 处第二次点火，使轨道变为圆轨道：", "\\[", "\\Delta v_1 = \\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{r_1}}\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{2r_2}{r_1 + r_2}} - 1\\right),", "\\qquad", "\\Delta v_2 = \\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{r_2}}\\left(1 - \\sqrt{\\frac{2r_1}{r_1 + r_2}}\\right),", "\\qquad", "t = \\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{(r_1 + r_2)^3}{8GM}} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由 $v^2 = GM(2/r - 1/a)$ 可求转移椭圆在 $r_1$ 与", "$r_2$ 处的速率，减去圆轨道速率，再", "\\cref{thm:b1:central-forces:conics}可得半个周期。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (2.5pt) node[below left] {$O$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) circle (1.0);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) circle (3.0);", "  % transfer ellipse: perigee r1=1 at (1,0), apogee r2=3 at (-3,0): a=2, c=1, center (-1,0), b=sqrt(3)=1.732", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (-1,0) ellipse (2 and 1.732);", "  \\fill[omThm] (1,0) circle (1.6pt); \\fill[omThm] (-3,0) circle (1.6pt);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo, very thick] (1,0) -- (1,1.0) node[right] {$\\Delta v_1$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo, very thick] (-3,0) -- (-3,-0.8) node[left] {$\\Delta v_2$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.5,-1.2) {$r_1$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize] at (2.6,2.3) {$r_2$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (-1.0,2.0) {转移椭圆};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm] (-0.2,1.72) -- (-0.8,1.73);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两圆轨道之间的霍曼转移：在内侧轨道上做第一次点火，", "将远地点抬至 $r_2$；半个椭圆之后，", "第二次点火抬高近地点——这是燃料最省的两次点火路径，并且", "也是探测器飞往火星所用的路线。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[从低轨道到地球静止轨道]\\label{ex:b1:central-forces:leogeo}", "$r_1 = \\qty{6770}{km}$, $r_2 = \\qty{42200}{km}$: $\\Delta v_1 = \\qty{2.4}{km/s}$,", "$\\Delta v_2 = \\qty{1.5}{km/s}$，滑行 \\qty{5.3}{h}。总量", "\\qty{3.9}{km/s}，约为发射入低轨道所耗量的一半。通往高轨道的", "“最后一英里”代价高昂，卫星为此须自带", "发动机。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[排斥中心]\\label{rem:b1:central-forces:rutherford}", "\\index{卢瑟福散射}", "对于排斥的平方反比力（两同号电荷，", "见\\cref{ch:b1:electrostatics-gauss}），有效势没有势阱：", "每条轨迹都是双曲线：粒子接近、", "被偏转后离开。把 $\\alpha$ 粒子直接射向金原子核时，其", "最近距离仅由能量决定，$E_k =", "2Ze^2/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 r_{\\min}$ --- 这是卢瑟福用以界定原子核大小的办法", "（\\cref{exo:b1:central-forces:11}）。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:1}", "国际空间站在 \\qty{400}{km} 高度处绕地球运行", "（$R_\\oplus = \\qty{6370}{km}$，$GM_\\oplus = \\qty{3.99e14}{m^3/s^2}$）。求其速率、", "周期及乘员每天所见的日出次数。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:2}", "求地球静止轨道的半径与高度，由", "恒星日 \\qty{86164}{s} 出发，并求其轨道速率。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:3}", "求地球与月球的逃逸速度（$GM = \\qty{4.90e12}{m^3/s^2}$，", "$R = \\qty{1740}{km}$）。月球为何没有大气层？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:4}", "火星 $a = \\qty{1.524}{AU}$，木星 \\qty{5.20}{AU}：由开普勒第三定律求", "它们的公转周期；位于 \\qty{30}{AU} 处（海王星）的天体，其周期为多少？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:5}", "求把 \\qty{1000}{kg} 的物体从地面静止出发送入", "国际空间站轨道所需的能量（忽略地球自转及空气阻力），", "并与汽油的化学能（\\qty{46}{MJ/kg}）相比较。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:6}", "哈雷彗星：近日点 \\qty{0.586}{AU}，远日点 \\qty{35.1}{AU}。", "求 $a$、$e$、周期，以及近日点与远日点处的速率，", "（$GM_\\odot = \\qty{1.33e20}{m^3/s^2}$，$\\qty{1}{AU} = \\qty{1.496e11}{m}$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:7}", "求从国际空间站轨道（\\qty{6770}{km}）到", "地球静止轨道的霍曼转移：两次点火的速度改变量、总量以及持续时间。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:central-forces:8}", "证明 $E_{p,\\mathrm{eff}}$ 的极小值位于 $r_c = L^2/GMm^2$，", "并证明在其附近的小径向振动具有角频率", "$\\sqrt{GM/r_c^3}$ --- 恰为轨道频率本身。这一结果对", "略受扰动的圆轨道说明了什么？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}